#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "KDebugDialog"
msgstr "KDebugDialog"

#. Tag: author
#: index.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "&David.Faure; &David.Faure.mail;"
msgstr "&David.Faure; &David.Faure.mail;"

#. Tag: trans_comment
#: index.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROLES_OF_TRANSLATORS"
msgstr "Uloge prevoditelja"

#. Tag: date
#: index.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "2011-12-20"
msgstr "2011-12-20"

#. Tag: releaseinfo
#: index.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "1.0 &kde; 4.8"
msgstr "1.0 &kde; 4.8"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"
msgstr "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "KDebugdialog"
msgstr "KDebugdialog"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "Otklanjanje neispravnosti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdebugdialog; is a dialog box for managing diagnostic messages at runtime. "
"It features a simple and a full mode."
msgstr ""
"&kdebugdialog;  je kutija za dijalog za upravljanje dijagnostickim porukama "
"za vrijeme izvođenja programa. Ona ima jednostav i pun nacin rada."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to be able to make changes <guilabel>Disable all debug output</"
"guilabel> has to be unchecked."
msgstr ""
"Da bi mogli napraviti izmjene  <guilabel>Isključi sve izlaze debagera</"
"guilabel> mora biti označeno."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Simple mode"
msgstr "Jednostavan nacin"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you simply start <command>kdebugdialog</command>, you will see a list of "
"<quote>areas</quote>, that can be disabled or enabled. A "
"<function>kDebug(area)</function> call in the code will show something in "
"the debug output only if the area is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Ako jednostavno zapocnete <command>kdebugdialog</command>, vidjet cete listu "
"<quote>areas</quote>, koja moze biti omogucena ili onemogucena. "
"<function>kDebug(area)</function> pozvana u kodu ce prikazati nesto na "
"izlazu gdje se ispisuje otkanjanje grsaka samo ako je podrucje omoguceno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that kWarning, kError and kFatal always appear, they are <emphasis>NOT</"
"emphasis> controlled by this setting."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da kWarning, kError i kFatal uvijek pojavljuju, oni "
"<emphasis>NISU</emphasis> kontrolisani ovom postavkom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter a matching string into the <guilabel>Search</guilabel> box at the top "
"of the list, this allows you to filter the areas which are displayed in the "
"list view. Use the buttons below the list to select or deselect all items in "
"the view (the other areas are not effected) or change the debug output for a "
"single item using the check box in front of it."
msgstr ""
"Unesite odgovarajući string u <guilabel> Search </guilabel> okvir na vrhu "
"liste, to vam omogućava da filtrirate područja koja su prikazana u prikazu "
"liste. Koristite tipke ispod liste za odabir ili poništite sve stavke u "
"prikazu (na drugim područjima nisu izvršena) ili promijeniti izlazni debug "
"za jednu stavku pomoću kućice ispred nje."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Full mode"
msgstr "Puni način"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you start <command>kdebugdialog</command> <option>--fullmode</option>, "
"then for every severity level you can define separately what should be done "
"with the diagnostic messages of that level, and the same for each debug area."
msgstr ""
"Ako pokrenete <command>kdebugdialog</command> <option>--fullmode</option>, "
"onda za svaki nivo ozbiljnosti mozete definisati sta zelite uraditi da "
"dijagnostickim porukama tog levela, i tako za svako podrucje debagovanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In full mode, first you should select the debug area you are interested in "
"from the list at the left of the dialog using the search box at the top of "
"the list."
msgstr ""
"U punom nacinu, prvo trebate oznaciti podrucje debagovanja koje vas "
"interseuje iz liste sa lijeve stane dijagloga koristeci kucicu za pretragu "
"na vrhu liste."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "You may independently set the output for various types of messages:"
msgstr "Možete samostalno podesiti izlaz za različite vrste poruka:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Information"
msgstr "Informacije"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Upozorenja"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Greška"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fatal Error"
msgstr "Fatalna greska"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "For each of these types, you can set the following:"
msgstr "Za svaki od ovih tipova, možete podesiti sljedeće:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "Output to:"
msgstr "Izlaz na:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this Combobox, you can choose where the messages should be output. The "
"choices are: <quote>File</quote>, <quote>Message Box</quote>, <quote>Shell</"
"quote> (meaning stderr) and <quote>Syslog</quote>. Please do not direct "
"fatal messages to syslog unless you are the system administrator yourself. "
"The default is <quote>Shell</quote>."
msgstr ""
"U ovom kombiniranom okviru možete izabrati gdje bi trebao biti izlaz za "
"poruke. Izbori su :<quote>Datoteka</quote>, <quote>Prozor s porukama</"
"quote>, <quote>Školjka</quote> (meaning stderr) i <quote>Syslog</quote>. "
"Molimo vas ne usmjeravajte fatalne poruke do syslog osim ukoliko ste "
"administrator. Standardno je  <quote>Školjka</quote>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "Filename:"
msgstr "Naziv:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is only enabled when you have chosen <quote>File</quote> as the output "
"and provides the name of that file (which is interpreted as relative to the "
"current folder). The default is <filename>kdebug.dbg</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je jedino dostupno kada ste izabrali <quote>Datoteka</quote>  kao izlaz "
"i naveli ime tog fajla( sto  interpretira u odnosu na trenutni fajl). "
"Standardno je <filename>kdebug.dbg</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Apart from this, you can also tick the check box <guilabel>Abort on fatal "
"errors</guilabel>. In this case, if a diagnostic message with the severity "
"level <computeroutput>KDEBUG_FATAL</computeroutput> is output, the "
"application aborts with a SIGABRT after outputting the message."
msgstr ""
"Osim toga, također možete označiti kućicu <guilabel>Prekini na fatalne "
"greške</guilabel>. U ovom slucaju ako je dijagnosticka poruka sa visokim "
"nivoom ozbiljnosti <computeroutput>KDEBUG_FATAL</computeroutput> na izlazu, "
"aplikacija prekida sa SIGABRT nakon izlaza poruke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you close the dialog by pressing <guibutton>OK</guibutton>, your "
"entries apply immediately and are saved in <filename>$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/"
"share/config/kdebugrc</filename>. When you press <guibutton>Cancel</"
"guibutton>, your entries are discarded and the old ones are restored."
msgstr ""
"Kada zatvorite dijlog pritiskom na <guibutton>U redu</guibutton> vaši unosi "
"se odmah snime u <filename>$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/share/config/kdebugrc</"
"filename>.  Kada pritisnete <guibutton>Otkaži</guibutton>,  vaši unosi su "
"odbačeni i stari vraćeni."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "Credits to Kalle Dalheimer for the original version of &kdebugdialog;"
msgstr "Krediti Kalle Dalheimer za originalnu verziju &kdebugdialog;"

